&lt;p&gt;What if your next enterprise deal could transform how a leading organization in the DACH market connects with its customers? As a Senior Enterprise Account Executive on Coveo’s EMEA team, you’ll bring our AI-powered solutions to enterprise organizations across Germany, Austria and Switzerland, turning ambitious business priorities into measurable outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll own complex enterprise sales cycles from prospecting through close, combining your knowledge of the DACH market, consultative selling skills and a strong partner ecosystem to build trusted relationships and create long-term customer value.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As one of our Senior Enterprise Account Executives, you will:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and execute strategic account plans for enterprise organizations across the DACH market, identifying opportunities where Coveo can deliver measurable business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop trusted relationships with key decision-makers and senior executives, navigating complex organizations to create new opportunities and lasting partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate and develop your own pipeline while partnering with Coveo’s alliances team and broader partner ecosystem to uncover and accelerate opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop compelling business proposals that connect Coveo’s artificial intelligence capabilities to each customer’s priorities, challenges and potential business value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage complex enterprise sales cycles end to end, assessing stakeholders, resources, timing, probability of closure and financial impact while maintaining accurate visibility into sales activity and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead opportunities through negotiation and close, securing agreements and consistently working toward quarterly and annual sales quotas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Here is what will qualify you for the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing complex enterprise software sales cycles in the DACH market, engaging stakeholders from business champions through senior executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in German and English, with the ability to build trusted relationships, lead business conversations and negotiate effectively in both languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong track record of generating your own enterprise opportunities and meeting or exceeding sales quotas in a results-driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A consultative and challenger-oriented sales approach, with the curiosity and discipline to understand sophisticated technology and translate it into clear customer value.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will make you stand out:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling enterprise artificial intelligence, generative artificial intelligence or other sophisticated technology solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MEDDPICC certification or demonstrated experience applying the methodology to complex enterprise sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An established understanding of the DACH enterprise landscape and experience developing opportunities alongside strategic technology or consulting partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A humble, curious and creative mindset, paired with the drive to build trusted customer relationships across different organizations and markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Do you think you can bring this role to life? Send us your application, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Base Salary:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;100,000 EUR to 120,000 EUR&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please note that the amount of the offer will depend on the candidate’s previous experience and skillset.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join the Coveolife!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt...

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SENIOR DEVOPS ENGINEER&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catapult is building the future of sports performance technology, with a mission to &lt;strong&gt;Unleash the Potential&lt;/strong&gt; of every athlete and team on earth. We don&#39;t just work in the sporting industry; we are actively changing it.&amp;nbsp; Since 2006, our solutions have been leading the way in sports performance software, science, and data, in a world where 1% can literally mean the difference between winning and losing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work with over 5,000+ teams around the world, empowering coaches, managers and trainers in premier teams in the NFL, NBA, NHL, MLS, EPL, AFL, NRL, NCAA and more. We provide the information they need to optimize athletes’ health, game-day readiness, and performance, as well as in-game tactics.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Catapult is a sports technology company that empowers professional teams to make data-driven decisions. We deliver health, performance, video, and AI insights from the locker room to competitive environments, ensuring every decision is an opportunity to gain an advantage, sharpen performance, and build lasting success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE WANT PEOPLE WHO ARE PASSIONATE ABOUT SOLVING HARD PROBLEMS&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior DevOps Engineer&lt;/strong&gt; to help build, operate and improve the infrastructure, platforms and tools that enable our teams to develop, deliver and run reliable software at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Based in Cologne, you will join a team with broad ownership of our technical environment. We take a cloud-agnostic approach, combining cloud services and self-hosted infrastructure to meet the needs of our products and engineering teams. Our responsibilities span the full lifecycle, from provisioning and deployment to observability, security and ongoing operation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will combine infrastructure expertise with automation and software engineering to improve how our software is built, deployed and operated. This includes streamlining development workflows, integrating and maintaining shared tools, and supporting demanding workloads across data processing, media and machine learning. Working closely with engineering teams and colleagues across the business, you will build practical solutions that support our expanding product portfolio.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who enjoys solving a wide range of technical problems, takes ownership from initial idea through to production, and thrives in a fast-growing environment where priorities and requirements evolve quickly. You will help shape how our infrastructure, platforms and tools adapt as the business grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Design, operate, and continuously improve our Kubernetes platform across both self-hosted clusters and AWS&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Own our infrastructure as code using Terraform and Ansible, driving a GitOps workflow to ensure all changes are versioned, reviewed, and reproducible&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Build and maintain robust CI/CD pipelines (GitLab CI) and shared templates that empower product teams to build, test, and deploy reliably&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Operate and scale specialized infrastructure for demanding workloads, including GPU clusters for computer vision models, media engines, and data analytics platforms&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Evolve our observability stack to proactively monitor system health, define meaningful alerting, and ensure high availability&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;em&gt;Drive platform security and compliance through continuous vulnerability scanning, automated image screening, robust secrets management, and strict access controls&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li...

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Staffbase&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We inspire people to achieve great things together. Our mission is to help organizations unlock the power of inspirational communication with the first &lt;strong&gt;AI-native Employee Experience Platform&lt;/strong&gt;. Our&lt;strong&gt; industry-leading and award-winning agentic AI communications channels&lt;/strong&gt; - intranet, employee app and email solutions - create engaging experiences that connect and empower employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Chemnitz, Germany and New York City, with offices in Berlin, London, Sydney, Tokyo, Prague, and Minneapolis–St. Paul, our diverse team of 550+ employees supports 1,500+ customers—reaching over 14 million employees—in transforming their employee experience.&lt;br&gt;We are proud to be a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Unicorn&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;company—privately valued at over $1 billion—demonstrating strong growth, innovation, and lasting impact in our industry. Together, we’re shaping the future of workplace communication.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Solutions Architect&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Our biggest deals rarely end with the standard product. Prospects want Staffbase to fit into their system landscape, their processes, and their way of working, and that is where deals are won or lost. As a Solutions Architect, you are the technical authority behind these deals in Europe. You understand the customer’s processes and the value they want to achieve, validate what is feasible, design the architecture, and prove it with a working showcase. Then you hand it over to our Build team so it becomes a production solution. You&#39;ll work closely with Solutions Engineers, Account Executives, and Build, and you&#39;ll have a direct impact on how we win our most complex opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Join strategic and technically complex opportunities in Europe early in the sales cycle, and support Solutions Engineers and Account Executives with solutioning, positioning, and technical credibility at executive and IT level&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Analyze and validate integration and customization requirements of prospects, from custom widgets and plugins to scripts, API integrations, SSO setups, and AI/agent use cases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Design the technical side of operational and frontline use cases, such as task management, HR self-service, shift planning or IT service requests, by connecting Staffbase to the systems employees work with every day&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;&quot;&gt;Understand the customer’s operational processes and workflows, advise on how Staffbase fits into them, and build the value case together with the Solutions Engineer and Account Executive: what improves, for whom, and how it is measured&lt;...

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Search AI Company, enables everyone to find the answers they need in real time, using all their data, at scale — unleashing the potential of businesses and people. The Elastic Search AI Platform, used by more than 50% of the Fortune 500, brings together the precision of search and the intelligence of AI to enable everyone to accelerate the results that matter. By taking advantage of all structured and unstructured data — securing and protecting private information more effectively — Elastic’s complete, cloud-based solutions for search, security, and observability help organizations deliver on the promise of AI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;543&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;20&quot;&gt;What Is The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Elastic, the Data Analytics, AI, Search, Observability &amp;amp; Security company; is seeking a dynamic Enterprise Account Executive for our Telecoms accounts. To excel as an Account Executive at Elastic, you need a blend of high-level technical curiosity and the gravitas of a value-based seller. Because Elastic isn&#39;t just a &quot;product&quot; but a versatile search, observability, and security platform, the role requires moving beyond simple transactions to solving complex data problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a dynamic Enterprise Account Executive, you will be an integral part of our growth strategy. You will drive net-new revenue and expansion within Enterprise Accounts in an assigned territory. This is an opportunity for those passionate about empowering companies through cutting-edge search technology and analytics, enabling them to unlock the full potential of their data.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;550&quot; data-end=&quot;578&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;550&quot; data-end=&quot;576&quot;&gt;What You Will Be Doing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Adoption:&lt;/strong&gt; Fuel the adoption of Elastic’s AI-powered search solutions, Observability and Security solutions within (new) Enterprise accounts while deepening engagement with existing ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a Trusted Advisor:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist users and customers in harnessing the full power of search analytics to transform data into actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; cloud acumen:&lt;/strong&gt; Position Elastic as the Search AI platform of choice by speaking fluently about cloud economics, usage-based pricing, and modern data architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solve Complex Problems:&lt;/strong&gt; Move beyond simple transactions to address the intricate data challenges our customers face.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Champion Open Source:&lt;/strong&gt; Articulate the value of our advanced commercial features while advocating for our Open-Source offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Identify New Use Cases:&lt;/strong&gt; Showcase how Elastic’s solutions enable users to work more efficiently and intelligently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Planning:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop comprehensive business plans leveraging community, customer, and partner ecosystems to drive significant territory growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Navigate Sales Cycles:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactively identify new opportunities and successfully manage complex sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deep discovery &amp;amp; qualification:&lt;/strong&gt; Uncover pain, business impact, budget, and decision criteria using frameworks like &lt;em&gt;MEDDPICC &lt;/em&gt;so you chase only the highest-confidence deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional partnership:&lt;/strong&gt; Work hand-in-glove with Solutions Architects, Customer Success, Marketing, and RevOps to accelerate deals and drive exceptional customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
